{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/System Control.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/System Control.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"system control system control","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/System Control.md","fileName":"System Control.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"System Control","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 13:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Spatial Interaction]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Spatial Interaction","Object Selection","3D Manipulation","3D Travel","Multimodal Interaction","Feedback","3D User Interface","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/System Control.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/System Control.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"system control system control","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/System Control.md","fileName":"System Control.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"System Control","heading":"System Control","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"System control is the task of issuing commands that request a function, change the interaction mode, or change system state. The user specifies what should happen and leaves the details of execution to the system.\n\nSystem control connects other tasks such as [[Object Selection]], [[3D Manipulation]], and [[3D Travel]]. It can use physical controllers, graphical menus, voice, gestures, tools, or [[Multimodal Interaction]].\n\nGood system control preserves the flow of action, limits focus and device switching, exposes available commands, organizes functions clearly, and provides unmistakable [[Feedback]] about the current mode. A 2D or hybrid control can be preferable even inside a [[3D User Interface]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Spatial Interaction","Object Selection","3D Manipulation","3D Travel","Multimodal Interaction","Feedback","3D User Interface","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/System Control.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/System Control.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"system control system control","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/System Control.md","fileName":"System Control.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"System Control","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Spatial Interaction","Object Selection","3D Manipulation","3D Travel","Multimodal Interaction","Feedback","3D User Interface","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}